      "writtenOn": "2014-11-14T06:07:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ideally I think spi_enable should be done is spi_flash.c file functions?\nThis one is a common folder file and hence didnt want to alter it.\nThe other place which is specific to this ec would be in chip/mec1322/flash.c. But if we add it only in this file then console commands in spi_flash.c wouldn\u0027t work. any thoughts?",
